        "markdown": "# Tyler Robinson Will Never Live to See His Acquittal\\n\\nA 21:19 Lionel Nation commentary published July 14, 2026. Lionel predicts that Tyler Robinson will not survive to trial, speculates about how an in-custody death might be narrated, invokes Jeffrey Epstein’s death as an analogy, urges reconciliation between Candace Owens and Erika Kirk, and challenges the prosecution theory concerning the rifle.\\n\\nPredictions, accusations, forensic assertions, and character judgments are attributed to Lionel. This graph does not present them as independently established facts.",
